<title>UK: Land Securities slips after debt issue.</title>
<headline>Land Securities slips after debt issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Land Securities fell on Monday after the company announced fund raising measures, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were 11-1/2p lower at 774p following news that the company planned a 200 million stg bond issue which will be convertible into shares.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
